msgid "结构"
msgstr "Structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/structure.md:3
#: c47ef75d68c64053868f732d4d27b003
msgid ""
"与卡片 UI 的“结构”分组一致。这些卡片负责随机排布、层状复制和逐原子结构分组： `Random Packing` 在输入晶胞中重新随机放置全部原子，`Layer "
"Stack` 复制完整层状结构， `Layer Groups` 沿晶面法向识别原子层并写入逐原子 A/B 标签。"
msgstr ""
"This section matches the `Structures` group in the card picker. These cards handle "
"random placement, layer-wise replication, and per-atom structural grouping: `Random "
"Packing` randomly relocates all atoms within the input cell, `Layer Stack` replicates"
" a complete layered structure, and `Layer Groups` identifies atomic layers along a "
"plane normal and writes per-atom A/B labels."
